  "limits": "One owned kind cluster with real Flux delivering podinfo from a public Git repository. Shows which cluster each receipt verify mode and the Flux tracer read, and that a bound receipt has the same content as a legacy one for the same cluster. Argo CD is not installed, so the bound Argo tracer is covered only by the deterministic test. It does not show cluster identity, read cost or Target binding, and it does not show a Git source anchor: see the receipt-anchor defect in the README."
